From f20b7727ace15949c768c87107c4963e8b0fe85a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: =?UTF-8?q?Ga=C3=ABl=20Duval?= <gael@murena.io>
Date: Mon, 5 Oct 2026 13:24:07 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 1/6] feat(documenteditor): Word Styles gallery, Styles pane
 and Modify Style

New DE.Controllers.WordFormatting (hooks: its declaration in app.js and
app_dev.js, the gallery item size and template in the Toolbar view, a
data-launcher on the Styles group):
- Styles gallery like Word: "AaBbCcDd" previews (84x40) with the style
  name below, Word's list and order (Normal, No Spacing, Heading 1-2,
  Title, Subtitle, emphasis, Strong, Quote, ..., Heading 3+ once the
  level above is used), live preview on hover: the style is applied
  inside a group action and reverted on leave, so nothing is saved,
  sent to co-authors or added to the undo stack;
- expanded gallery: Create a Style, Clear Formatting, Apply Styles...;
  Modify... in the item menu;
- Styles pane (Ctrl+Alt+Shift+S, Styles group launcher): floating
  pane at the right with Clear All, the styles and their type, the
  current style highlighted, a menu per style (Update to Match
  Selection, Modify..., Delete.../Revert to Default), Show Preview,
  New Style and Clear Formatting;
- Apply Styles box (style name with completion, Reapply, Modify...,
  Styles pane) and Modify Style / Create New Style from Formatting
  dialog (name, type, based on, next style, font, size, bold, italic,
  underline, colour, alignment, line spacing, spacing before, indent,
  preview, Add to the Styles gallery, Format > Font...).
Uses the sdkjs gallery options, style preview and style modification
APIs. Strings in en, fr, de, es, it, pt, pt-pt, nl, ru, pl, ja, zh.

[branding]

